Source: alx-update
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Algothix OS Maintainers <maintainers@algothix.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://algothix.com

Package: alx-update
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, apt, systemd
Description: AC-power and idle-aware system updater for Algothix OS (ALX) Lite
 Wraps apt-get update and apt-get full-upgrade with AC-power and CPU-load idle
 checks so old laptops do not thrash on battery or during active coding
 sessions. Includes an optional systemd timer and prints a concise summary.
